     1	"""The gatekeeper: the one holder of merge, deploy and spend (task #11).
     2	
     3	The tests that matter here are the refusals. A gatekeeper that grants correctly and
     4	refuses sloppily is not a gatekeeper — so most of what follows is an agent asking for
     5	something it hasn't earned, in every way we could think of.
     6	
     7	The recurring theme: the request is never believed. Every check re-reads the record.
     8	"""
     9	
