The strongest problems are now clear: the branch labels the gatekeeper finished even though the stated security boundary is still absent, the successful review path never asks it to merge, and its “deploy” success consumes approval without deploying anything. I’m doing one final pass over the exact line references and separating those real failures from weaker documentation-only concerns before issuing the verdict.
